; Clone Andy's theme, "Copy Protocol": F-sharp minor, 128 bpm, 32-bar loop: a relentless, slightly mechanical Black Hole drive. Pedal synth bass (A.52) on a syncopated sixteenth pattern, a steady pulse, held strings, and a lead that creeps by half steps and leaps a tritone; the second half develops the same lead (a bridge over D and E, then the hook again). Original notes, no rom lines
; Original notes, written in the idiom of AW2's Black Hole CO themes (aw2dev sound study); no rom lines.
song cloneandy
tempo 128
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst lead = A.24 shift=0
inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst arp = A.28 shift=12
inst bass = A.52 shift=0
inst kit = A.120

hit kick=36 snare=52 hat=42 ohat=46 tom1=43 tom2=45 crash=49

track 1 inst=lead vol=90 pan=10 vel=116 gate=88 gain=0.85
track 2 inst=str vol=60 pan=-30 vel=96 gate=98 gain=0.8
track 3 inst=arp vol=70 pan=30 vel=100 gate=55 gain=0.35
track 4 inst=bass vol=95 pan=0 vel=118 gate=80 gain=1.0
track 5 inst=kit vol=76 pan=0 vel=112 gate=100 gain=0.7
track 6 inst=kit vol=60 pan=12 vel=100 gate=100 gain=0.25

